<!-- Excerpt of EEBO-TCP A12190, Sibbes, The returning backslider, or, A commentarie upon the whole XIIII. chapter of the prophecy of the prophet Hosea (1639), CC0 1.0, as keyed: the openings of all sixteen sermons, labelled from Hosea 14.1 to 14.10, and of The Saints Priviledge, the treatise on John 16 bound after them. Each sermon keeps its heading and its quoted text, and the treatise its heading and first paragraph, cut short. -->
   <text>
